Understand the JSON structure
Your Movie model contains seven fields:
Field	JSON type
id	String
title	String
synopsis	String
ageRating	String
screeningTime	String
ticketPrice	Number
posterImagePath	String

For example, one movie would look like this:

{
  "id": "iron-man",
  "title": "Iron Man",
  "synopsis": "A superhero film about Iron Man.",
  "ageRating": "12A",
  "screeningTime": "18:00",
  "ticketPrice": 7.50,
  "posterImagePath": "assets/images/iron man.jpeg"
}
